// Memory: SEXPREC node and data buffer are heap-allocated via malloc().
// They are NOT arena-managed: the returned SEXPs are part of the .Call
// return list and must outlive the function frame.  Python extracts data
// into numpy arrays and calls free_sexp() to release both allocations.
// On allocation failure, allocVector (called by allocMatrix) throws RError.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

